            "💢 Exhaustion"        => "💢 Esaurimento"
            "▲ Bull Lean"          => "▲ Incl. Rialzista"
            "▼ Bear Lean"          => "▼ Incl. Ribassista"
            "⚠ Mixed"              => "⚠ Misti"
